msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: basalt-assistant\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-10-21 23:00-0300\n"
"Last-Translator: Basalt OS project <feedback@basalt-os.org>\n"
"Language-Team: Brazilian Portuguese <feedback@basalt-os.org>\n"
"Language: pt_BR\n"
